1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:03,437
A ball of fire, floating in the air.

2
00:00:03,462 --> 00:00:05,795
It glows for a second.

3
00:00:05,913 --> 00:00:07,825
Then it's gone.

4
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:12,528
1638. A storm over Dartmoor, in England.

5
00:00:12,548 --> 00:00:16,237
Witnesses describe a great ball of fire

6
00:00:16,298 --> 00:00:19,074
coming through a church window.

7
00:00:19,183 --> 00:00:22,382
For centuries, it was only stories.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,932
Then, in 2012,

9
00:00:24,952 --> 00:00:29,032
scientists recording lightning in western China

10
00:00:29,135 --> 00:00:32,074
catch one on their spectrometer.

11
00:00:32,163 --> 00:00:36,075
900 m away. About 1 second.

12
00:00:36,202 --> 00:00:40,064
Its light shows silicon, iron and calcium.

13
00:00:40,096 --> 00:00:42,274
The stuff of soil.

14
00:00:42,404 --> 00:00:46,665
Lightning hits the ground. The ground burns.

15
00:00:46,731 --> 00:00:49,183
Labs can make small ones.

16
00:00:49,327 --> 00:00:53,036
In 2007, a team in Brazil

17
00:00:53,077 --> 00:00:56,934
touches an electric arc to a silicon wafer.

18
00:00:56,971 --> 00:01:00,479
Glowing balls, up to 4 cm.

19
00:01:00,577 --> 00:01:02,606
Up to 8 seconds.

20
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,578
Ember asks the next question.

21
00:01:05,625 --> 00:01:08,004
What if it never went out?

22
00:01:08,077 --> 00:01:10,479
Feed it silicon dust.

23
00:01:10,529 --> 00:01:13,373
Hold it in a magnetic cage.

24
00:01:13,413 --> 00:01:15,981
Draw power from its glow.

25
00:01:16,010 --> 00:01:18,583
Trial one. 8 seconds.

26
00:01:18,606 --> 00:01:20,406
Held.

27
00:01:20,481 --> 00:01:22,362
90 seconds.

28
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:24,300
Held.

29
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:26,175
6 hours.

30
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:28,050
Held.

31
00:01:28,702 --> 00:01:30,899
One side effect.

32
00:01:31,010 --> 00:01:34,657
Every radio on the floor fills with static.

33
00:01:34,904 --> 00:01:37,845
Ember is cleared for field trials.

34
00:01:38,077 --> 00:01:41,434
The storm's ball lasted 1 second.

35
00:01:41,538 --> 00:01:44,302
Ember has to last all night.
